---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — PokerDealsHub"
  description="PokerDealsHub Privacy Policy: data usage, cookies, and information protection"
>
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold text-gold mb-8">Privacy Policy</h1>

      <div class="prose prose-invert max-w-none">
        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <p class="text-neutral-300 mb-4">
            Last updated: October 19, 2025
          </p>
          <p class="text-neutral-300">
            PokerDealsHub ("we", "our", "us") is committed to protecting the privacy of visitors to our website.
            This policy describes how we collect, use, and protect your information.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300 mb-3">We may collect the following types of information:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 text-neutral-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Information you provide when contacting us (name, email, contact details)</li>
            <li>Technical data (IP address, browser type, operating system)</li>
            <li>Website interaction data (pages visited, time spent on the site)</li>
            <li>Cookies and similar tracking technologies</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">2. Use of Information</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300 mb-3">We use the collected information to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 text-neutral-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Provide and improve our services</li>
            <li>Contact you regarding cooperation or partnership</li>
            <li>Analyze site usage and optimize functionality</li>
            <li>Ensure website security</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">3. Use of Cookies</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300 mb-3">
            Our website uses cookies to improve site performance, analyze traffic, and store your preferences.
            You can manage cookies through your browser settings. We use:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 text-neutral-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Analytical cookies to understand user behavior</li>
            <li>Functional cookies to save your preferences (e.g., language)</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">4. Data Sharing with Third Parties</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300">
            We do not sell or share your personal information with third parties, except when necessary
            to provide services (e.g., analytics providers) or when required by law.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">5. Data Security</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300">
            We take reasonable measures to protect your information from unauthorized access,
            alteration, disclosure, or destruction.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8 mb-6">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">6. Your Rights</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300 mb-3">You have the right to:</p>
          <ul class="list-disc ml-6 text-neutral-300 space-y-2">
            <li>Request access to your personal information</li>
            <li>Request correction of inaccurate information</li>
            <li>Request deletion of your information</li>
            <li>Withdraw consent for data processing</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-neutral-900 border border-neutral-800 rounded-xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gold mb-4">7. Contact</h2>
          <p class="text-neutral-300 mb-3">
            If you have any questions about our Privacy Policy, please contact us:
          </p>
          <p class="text-neutral-300">
            Email: <a href="mailto:pokerdealshub@gmail.com" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-light">pokerdealshub@gmail.com</a><br>
            Telegram: <a href="https://t.me/pokerdealshub" class="text-gold hover:text-gold-light" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">@PokerDealsHub</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
